\**{c=red:Note:}** Completing the Quest {q:Open Sesame|Open Sesame|Open Sesame} will allow you to pass by the weighted **Ornate Doors** within the {z:Quicksand Caves} solo with the {@k} {k:Loadstone} Key Item. Getting through the {z:Quicksand Caves} is required to reach your objective in this Mission.
=2 Walkthrough
!Western Altepa Desert.jpg|right|Western Altepa
!Quicksand Caves-map7.jpg|right|Quicksand Map 7
!Quicksand Caves-map5.jpg|right|Quicksand Map 5
!Quicksand Caves-map6.jpg|right|Quicksand Map 6
Trade enough {p:Crystals} to the {p:Conquest NPC} to raise your Rank bar and unlock the Mission, then accept it from the {n:Gate Guard}.
* Visit {n:Iron Eater} at the **President's Office** in {z:Metalworks}. You'll be asked to travel through the {z:Quicksand Caves}.
** Continue to talk to {n:Iron Eater} until the text repeats the same and does not change.
* Head for the tunnel at (G-5) in {z:Western Altepa Desert} to enter {z:Quicksand Caves} Map 7.
** Taking the {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Kuftal Tunnel} and then exiting brings you close to this entrance.
* Make your way to (H-8) where you'll have to open the weighted **Ornate Door**. Simply stand on the nearby weight sensor and wait a few seconds.
** Requires 3 points to open the doors: {p:Galka} = 3 points; {p:Hume}/{p:Elvaan}/{p:Mithra} = 2 points; {p:Tarutaru} = 1 point.
** This door can be opened solo if you possess the {@k} {k:Loadstone} from the quest {q:Open Sesame|Open Sesame|Open Sesame}.
* Open the next weighted **Ornate Door** at (I-10). Go through and reach (G-11) where you'll find yourself in a small room.
* Clear out the room, and then check the **???** in front of the **Galka Statue** to spawn 3 level 70 {m:Antica} NMs.
** This fight is trivial at 99 with {p:Trusts|Trust}, but you will fight against:
** {m:Triarius IV-XIV} ({p:BLM})
** {m:Princeps IV-XLV} ({p:PLD})
** {m:Centurio IV-VII} ({p:WAR})
** They can be {s:slept|Sleep}.
** It is recommended you defeat them in that order, however a well-balanced party should have little difficulty with them.
* Check the **Galka Statue** again once the bodies have disappeared for a cutscene with {n:Zeid}.
* Leave and proceed to (D-12) of {z:Western Altepa Desert} and enter {z:Quicksand Caves} Map 5.
** This entrance is hidden and is accessed at (C/D-11) in the far south-west corner.
** You can also quickly access the next **???** via the {p:Geomagnetic Fount} {p:Waypoint} for {z:Quicksand Caves}. If you don't have this Fount yet, it is highly recommended you pick it up while in the vicinity. Around (F-7) Map 5.
* Inside, head through the eastern weighted **Ornate Doors** at (K-8) this will take you to Map 6.
* Go east to another weight device at (G-8) and proceed east again.
* The **???** you need is on the floor infront of the mural in the room at (H-8). Check it for a cutscene with {n:Zeid}.
* Return to {n:Iron Eater} for a final cutscene.

]=],
